if_pair provides pairs of cross-connected point-to-point layer-3
interfaces (pairNa/pairNb) for IPv4 and IPv6 connectivity between vnet
jails, or between the jail host and vnet jails.

Unlike epair(4), no Ethernet layer is emulated: there are no MAC
addresses, no ARP/NDP neighbor discovery and no link-layer headers.  A
packet transmitted on one side is handed directly to the peer's
protocol input path in the peer's vnet, with TCP/UDP checksum
computation elided for traffic that never leaves the machine.

Load with: kldload if_pair
Create with: ifconfig pair create
